sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as User
    participant M as mer
    participant T as Ghostty
    U->>M: cat diagram.mmd | mer -
    M->>T: CSI 16 t (cell size?)
    T-->>M: cell is 17x38 px
    M->>T: OSC 11 ? (background?)
    T-->>M: rgb:1e1e/1e1e/2e2e
    Note over M: parse, layout, rasterize
    M->>T: APC G a=T,f=100 (chunked)
    T-->>U: diagram appears inline
    loop follow mode
        M->>M: debounce new stdin bytes
        M->>T: replace image i=1 in place
    end
